# Copy to ~/.config/foryield/soroban-onboarding.env (chmod 600), NOT into this
# repository: it is public, and DFNS_AUTH_TOKEN plus DFNS_PRIVATE_KEY are live
# credentials. Override the location with ONBOARDING_ENV_FILE.
#
# Use a DFNS service account scoped to this project alone.
DFNS_API_URL=https://api.dfns.io
DFNS_AUTH_TOKEN=
DFNS_CRED_ID=
DFNS_PRIVATE_KEY=
STELLAR_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org
STELLAR_HORIZON_URL=https://horizon-testnet.stellar.org
#
# VAULT_CONTRACT_ID is deliberately absent. The current demo vault is the
# default in src/config.ts, kept in step with the redeployment runbook. Freezing
# it into a local copy of this file creates one more pointer, outside the
# repository, that nobody remembers to update: on 2026-08-04 an onboarding run
# deposited into the June instance for exactly that reason, while the repository
# already pointed at the right one. Set it only to aim at a DIFFERENT instance
# on purpose, for the length of one command:
#
#   VAULT_CONTRACT_ID=C... npm run onboard -- <email> <stroops>
